WEBVTT

00:16.870 --> 00:17.850
Who are you?

00:18.330 --> 00:19.780
Where is my master,

00:20.070 --> 00:20.800
Zhang Haiqi?

00:21.420 --> 00:22.280
She's dead too.

00:24.120 --> 00:25.300
Everyone but us

00:26.070 --> 00:26.760
died.

00:26.910 --> 00:27.640
Impossible.

00:28.160 --> 00:29.760
Do you know how strong she is?

00:30.920 --> 00:32.720
Why would all the people you know

00:33.770 --> 00:35.450
be the favored ones?

00:36.380 --> 00:38.250
Isn't Zhang Haixia dead too?

00:41.000 --> 00:41.790
Mr. Zhang,

00:42.920 --> 00:44.380
the Archives is long gone.

00:45.880 --> 00:47.200
She's already dead.

00:47.920 --> 00:49.460
What's the point of

00:49.460 --> 00:51.260
trying to get to the bottom of it?

00:53.570 --> 00:54.250
Leave.

00:55.880 --> 00:57.540
No one will blame you anymore.

01:00.150 --> 01:02.480
No one will care about you anymore either.

01:32.650 --> 01:34.110
The people in the Archives

01:34.289 --> 01:37.220
are to be buried
by a higher-level agent after death.

01:38.200 --> 01:39.660
You're a low-level agent.

01:39.759 --> 01:40.890
Strictly speaking,

01:41.450 --> 01:44.479
low-level agents are not considered
to be from the Archives.

01:44.479 --> 01:45.940
I'm afraid you haven't even

01:45.940 --> 01:47.400
been in the real Archives.

02:00.540 --> 02:02.230
You can take him away.

02:02.870 --> 02:04.400
Bury him wherever you want.

02:05.620 --> 02:07.150
What else can you do for him?

03:12.110 --> 03:15.120
[Zhang Haiqi] [Zhang Haixia]
[Zhang Hailou]

03:17.630 --> 03:19.630
[Zhang Haiqi] [Zhang Haixia]
[Zhang Hailou]

03:29.310 --> 03:30.500
[Zhang Haixia]

04:17.500 --> 04:19.140
You can take him away.

04:19.690 --> 04:21.220
Bury him wherever you want.

04:22.620 --> 04:24.150
What else can you do for him?

04:24.230 --> 04:26.650
[Zhang Haiqi] [Zhang Haixia]

04:33.700 --> 04:36.240
Mo Yungao put Twilight Grass in Nanyang.

04:36.480 --> 04:37.450
He then brought it back

04:37.450 --> 04:39.250
to Xiacheng through the Nan'an.

04:39.370 --> 04:43.420
[Urgent]

04:40.060 --> 04:41.620
What's his next plan?

04:46.250 --> 04:47.159
I'm sorry,

04:46.320 --> 04:48.280
[Zhang Haixia]

04:47.330 --> 04:48.070
Haixia.

04:48.820 --> 04:50.070
I have to do this.

04:55.880 --> 04:58.530
[Zhang Haiqi] [Zhang Haixia]
[Zhang Hailou]

05:02.450 --> 05:04.170
Zhang Hailou, Zhang Hailou.

05:05.690 --> 05:08.290
How did my student, you,
turn out to be trouble?

05:10.850 --> 05:12.700
I'll give you another chance.

05:13.170 --> 05:15.230
As for what fate awaits the two of you,

05:16.070 --> 05:19.330
that depends on whether you can
overcome your true nature.

06:53.250 --> 06:59.380
[Archives: The Nanyang Mystery]

06:59.800 --> 07:02.380
[Episode 12]

07:07.000 --> 07:08.250
The night tide is ebbs slow.

07:08.250 --> 07:09.330
We didn't find anything.

07:09.330 --> 07:10.100
Yeah.

07:12.320 --> 07:13.850
Why is there someone there?

07:13.920 --> 07:14.380
What...

07:15.120 --> 07:16.160
Take a fire statement to light it.

07:16.160 --> 07:17.220
Are they refugees?

07:34.430 --> 07:37.659
[Assassin, Bai Zhu]

07:34.710 --> 07:35.570
Sir.

07:45.100 --> 07:48.380
[Lu Junxiang, Adjutant
in the Mo Warlord Faction of Beilian]

07:46.760 --> 07:48.460
I need to know

07:48.890 --> 07:50.690
the situation of the Nan'an.

07:56.159 --> 07:57.330
Please

07:58.210 --> 07:59.760
promise me one thing first.

08:03.410 --> 08:04.600
Say it.

08:05.520 --> 08:06.700
I want to see Bai Yu.

08:18.500 --> 08:19.580
Sure.

08:22.570 --> 08:24.100
Our mission to assassinate

08:24.450 --> 08:26.500
people of the Archives in Nanyang

08:26.500 --> 08:29.300
successfully wiped out
32 people of the Archives.

08:29.420 --> 08:32.350
Most of them were poisoned
by Twilight Grass Poison.

08:32.840 --> 08:33.909
But unexpectedly,

08:34.200 --> 08:35.840
there were survivors.

08:36.530 --> 08:38.340
They seem to have antibodies.

08:38.789 --> 08:41.690
The Twilight Grass Poison can't kill them.

08:41.789 --> 08:43.809
It can only make them hallucinate.

08:43.919 --> 08:45.450
I've submitted the report.

08:46.370 --> 08:47.170
On top of that,

08:47.550 --> 08:49.100
the director of the Archives,

08:49.100 --> 08:50.390
Zhang Haiqi...

08:52.330 --> 08:53.770
appeared on the Nan'an.

08:56.610 --> 08:58.810
She boarded the boat
as the daughter of the Ship King.

08:58.810 --> 09:00.370
Because of her counterattack,

09:00.370 --> 09:01.960
all the people we sent

09:01.960 --> 09:03.080
were killed.

09:03.520 --> 09:05.450
Only I survived.

09:05.750 --> 09:06.790
We seldom had the chance

09:06.790 --> 09:08.370
to get close to each other.

09:08.370 --> 09:10.430
Zhang Haiqi has arrived in Xiacheng.

09:11.120 --> 09:11.910
Sorry.

09:20.170 --> 09:22.250
You finally showed up.

09:29.650 --> 09:31.470
Sir, I want to see Bai Yu.

09:31.490 --> 09:32.660
Take me to Bai Yu!

09:32.860 --> 09:34.110
Let me see her!

09:56.530 --> 09:57.580
She appeared.

09:58.260 --> 09:59.300
She appeared!

09:59.960 --> 10:01.160
Where is my medicine?

10:09.410 --> 10:11.160
Get ready.

10:11.960 --> 10:13.460
To the Dong Residence.

10:18.190 --> 10:22.260
[A place derives glory
from its illustrious sons]

10:52.790 --> 10:53.460
Let's go.

10:53.910 --> 10:55.520
Who buys a coffin on tab?

10:55.650 --> 10:57.000
On the dead person's tab
on top of that?

10:57.000 --> 10:58.800
If you don't have money, just go.

11:08.620 --> 11:10.150
I'll trade for it with this.

11:21.750 --> 11:23.210
He's pulling two coffins.

11:23.220 --> 11:24.610
Stop looking.

12:42.530 --> 12:43.580
Zhang Hailou.

12:51.910 --> 12:52.750
Miss Dong?

12:59.350 --> 13:00.330
Master!

13:02.910 --> 13:03.830
Miss Dong,

13:04.150 --> 13:05.550
are you really my master?

13:10.840 --> 13:12.030
I knew it...

13:15.080 --> 13:15.720
Master.

13:17.030 --> 13:17.870
Master.

13:18.570 --> 13:19.580
Master.

13:20.150 --> 13:20.940
Master.

13:30.790 --> 13:31.590
Zhang Hailou.

13:32.640 --> 13:34.410
Ever having you as my student

13:34.530 --> 13:36.790
is the most humiliating thing in my life.

13:37.370 --> 13:39.440
I should have drowned you in the sea.

13:39.960 --> 13:42.160
So many things wouldn't have happened.

13:46.200 --> 13:47.660
The higher-ups are right.

13:49.620 --> 13:51.680
People like you shouldn't be kept.

13:59.070 --> 13:59.770
Master.

14:00.650 --> 14:01.530
I know...

14:03.750 --> 14:05.610
you blame me for killing Shrimpie

14:06.530 --> 14:07.910
and harming the Archives.

14:07.910 --> 14:09.440
That's why you're mad at me.

14:11.700 --> 14:12.330
Mentor!

14:13.110 --> 14:13.980
Just kill me.

14:15.120 --> 14:16.220
Kill me!

14:16.340 --> 14:17.150
Kill me!

14:18.080 --> 14:18.960
Kill you?

14:20.250 --> 14:20.790
If I kill you,

14:20.790 --> 14:22.790
will Zhang Haixia come back to life?

14:23.000 --> 14:25.860
Will the people
from the Archives come back to life?

14:33.120 --> 14:33.960
Master...

14:35.610 --> 14:36.440
Master...

14:38.150 --> 14:38.790
All these years,

14:38.790 --> 14:41.050
so many things happened in the Archives—

14:41.460 --> 14:43.370
why didn't you send me a telegram?

14:44.000 --> 14:46.200
Zhang Haixia is higher ranked than you.

14:47.080 --> 14:48.740
He knows everything,

14:49.420 --> 14:50.480
yet you don't know?

14:51.910 --> 14:53.500
You should ask him why.

14:53.720 --> 14:54.560
Master.

14:54.910 --> 14:55.910
I know I was wrong.

14:58.840 --> 15:00.400
Back then in Panhua Reef,

15:00.580 --> 15:01.710
If it weren't for me,

15:01.790 --> 15:03.990
Shrimpie wouldn't have been disabled.

15:05.410 --> 15:06.620
I know I was wrong.

15:14.120 --> 15:15.590
So he knew...

15:18.290 --> 15:19.340
But he didn't tell me

15:19.340 --> 15:20.370
to protect me.

15:21.200 --> 15:22.140
All these years,

15:23.200 --> 15:25.000
how many things has he not told me

15:25.390 --> 15:27.660
to protect me?

15:29.620 --> 15:31.520
Why didn't I know until now?

15:35.840 --> 15:36.570
Master.

15:37.030 --> 15:37.840
You knew

15:37.840 --> 15:39.650
I would kill Zhang Haixia, right?

15:39.650 --> 15:40.340
Master,

15:40.530 --> 15:42.960
you told me again and again
to overcome my true nature.

15:42.960 --> 15:45.060
But I realized it too late.

15:45.870 --> 15:47.650
It's too late...

15:50.790 --> 15:51.620
Why did you...

15:52.500 --> 15:53.950
Why did you let him

15:53.980 --> 15:55.290
go to Nanyang with me?

15:55.290 --> 15:57.170
Why did you watch him

15:57.190 --> 15:58.270
die because of me?

15:58.530 --> 16:00.080
You knew I am...

16:00.500 --> 16:01.620
I am such a person.

16:01.620 --> 16:02.470
Why did you...

16:02.790 --> 16:04.510
Why did you bring me back

16:04.540 --> 16:05.640
and not let me die?

16:14.300 --> 16:15.100
Are you done?

16:24.500 --> 16:26.650
Master, I know I was wrong.

16:27.460 --> 16:28.920
Bodhisattva fears karma.

16:29.620 --> 16:31.280
A man fears the consequences.

16:32.750 --> 16:34.200
You chose to be a man

16:34.200 --> 16:36.720
because you didn't pay a big enough price.

16:37.050 --> 16:38.710
Now, if you want good results,

16:39.290 --> 16:41.020
you need to start sowing karma.

16:41.840 --> 16:42.700
Remember,

16:44.000 --> 16:46.530
no one in this world will help you

16:47.030 --> 16:48.300
like Zhang Haixia.

16:59.620 --> 17:00.620
I know.

17:01.960 --> 17:02.760
Master.

17:13.250 --> 17:15.780
Although committing suicide
is a cheap move,

17:17.250 --> 17:19.510
you have more conscience
than I thought.

17:19.920 --> 17:21.579
Since you have the guts to die,

17:21.660 --> 17:23.859
why don't you die a more valuable death?

17:24.069 --> 17:25.790
Think with your brain.

17:26.960 --> 17:28.790
Zhang Haixia's a smart man.

17:29.330 --> 17:31.590
Why would he wait for someone to kill him?

17:34.770 --> 17:36.170
What do you mean, Master?

17:39.390 --> 17:41.070
I checked all his vitals.

17:41.070 --> 17:42.220
He's dead.

17:46.460 --> 17:49.100
There is a very special way
to save his life.

17:50.110 --> 17:52.370
Only a few people in the Archives know it.

17:56.110 --> 17:56.570
Master...

17:56.570 --> 17:57.960
Zhang Haixia

17:58.790 --> 18:00.520
has a possibility of survival.

18:03.070 --> 18:04.650
Strictly speaking,

18:05.460 --> 18:06.890
he is now

18:07.070 --> 18:08.720
between life and death.

18:09.790 --> 18:11.390
Whether he can survive or not

18:12.700 --> 18:15.100
depends on whether
he can enter that place.

18:16.200 --> 18:16.920
Follow me.

18:18.380 --> 18:19.440
Pick up your shoes.

18:37.030 --> 18:39.950
The serial number of the information
in the Archives has a pattern.

18:39.950 --> 18:41.400
The smaller the number,

18:41.930 --> 18:43.400
the more recent it happened.

18:42.790 --> 18:44.720
[Southern Archives Document]

18:43.920 --> 18:44.960
011.

18:46.250 --> 18:47.500
Is it so old?

18:48.160 --> 18:49.760
In the 25th year of Daoguang,

18:50.070 --> 18:51.470
weird issues happened

18:51.790 --> 18:53.560
in many villages in Xiacheng Mountain.

18:53.560 --> 18:55.070
[Case Closure Report]

18:53.920 --> 18:56.950
Some villagers saw
evil spirits crawling out of the crack.

18:56.950 --> 18:59.480
The Archives were assisting
and sent someone

18:59.690 --> 19:03.350
to go thousands of meters underground
through the crack of the mountain

19:03.350 --> 19:05.600
to find a different realm underground—
the Underworld.

19:05.600 --> 19:07.450
In order to protect the Underworld

19:07.450 --> 19:09.060
to protect the people of Xiacheng,

19:09.060 --> 19:11.830
the Archives was built upon the Underworld

19:11.880 --> 19:13.530
to prevent things inside

19:13.530 --> 19:14.790
from causing trouble.

19:18.290 --> 19:19.750
But what does this have to do

19:19.750 --> 19:20.920
with Shrimpie's death?

19:20.920 --> 19:22.100
Keep reading.

19:22.120 --> 19:22.660
Okay.

19:28.290 --> 19:31.100
The agents found a body of water

19:31.290 --> 19:33.150
while exploring the Underworld.

19:33.660 --> 19:34.920
Strangely,

19:35.110 --> 19:37.070
when an agent enters the water,

19:37.200 --> 19:38.750
their body temperature will drop sharply

19:38.750 --> 19:40.010
and die mysteriously.

19:46.210 --> 19:47.280
Later it was found

19:47.330 --> 19:48.750
they didn't die.

19:49.330 --> 19:51.700
Instead, they are in
a long fake-death state

19:51.700 --> 19:54.500
without breath or pulse.

19:58.200 --> 20:00.660
A parasitic worm on them

20:00.860 --> 20:02.890
can remove the toxin of Haizun.

20:04.400 --> 20:07.500
Just like how cows and sheep
can eat poisonous wild grass—

20:07.500 --> 20:09.500
the parasitic bacteria in their stomachs

20:09.500 --> 20:11.030
can help detoxify the poison.

20:11.030 --> 20:13.560
They are both
on the same and different sides.

20:25.610 --> 20:26.940
The Archives found that

20:27.070 --> 20:29.980
this is a good way to escape.

20:30.200 --> 20:32.460
So I made them into two kinds of medicine.

20:32.680 --> 20:33.560
They can be used

20:33.580 --> 20:35.790
during the most dangerous missions—

20:36.070 --> 20:38.030
to feign death
to fool the enemies

20:38.330 --> 20:40.530
and bring back the secret information.

20:40.830 --> 20:42.880
So Shrimpie's death is a fake one?

20:43.910 --> 20:45.250
What about the antidote?
Why...

20:45.250 --> 20:46.660
Why didn't he take the antidote?

20:46.660 --> 20:49.180
Because the way to make the antidote
is very troublesome.

20:49.180 --> 20:51.390
And I am still short of three rare herbs.

20:51.420 --> 20:53.000
I'll find it. Where is it?

20:53.500 --> 20:55.160
In the depths of the Archives.

20:55.880 --> 20:56.410
Depth...

20:56.670 --> 20:57.540
Depths?

20:57.890 --> 21:00.340
Three years ago, when you caused
the trouble in Panhua Reef,

21:00.340 --> 21:05.410
[Three years ago]

21:00.650 --> 21:02.830
people of the Archives were hunted down.

21:02.830 --> 21:04.460
To prevent enemy invasion,

21:04.480 --> 21:06.290
I closed the Archives ahead of time

21:06.290 --> 21:08.750
and dismissed everyone
in the Zhang family.

21:09.440 --> 21:13.920
[Dragon-breaking Stone mechanism]

21:19.960 --> 21:22.820
I then turned on
all the defense mechanisms around

21:23.290 --> 21:24.800
to protect the Archives,

21:25.000 --> 21:27.660
not allowing anyone to break into
the Archives.

21:28.880 --> 21:30.250
But actually,

21:30.700 --> 21:33.500
there is another secret entrance
to the Archives.

21:33.660 --> 21:36.380
This entrance has a set
of complicated defense mechanisms

21:36.380 --> 21:38.510
and changes its location constantly.

21:39.380 --> 21:40.500
This mechanism was designed

21:40.500 --> 21:43.660
by different high-ranking agents taking
different phases each over the years.

21:43.660 --> 21:44.790
No one in the Archives

21:44.790 --> 21:46.760
knows how to crack it completely,

21:47.160 --> 21:47.960
including me.

21:52.940 --> 21:55.210
The last agent
who participated in the design

21:55.210 --> 21:56.380
was Zhang Haixia.

21:57.000 --> 21:59.010
If someone can open this mechanism,

21:59.290 --> 22:00.980
it could only be you.

22:04.460 --> 22:06.320
So if I want to enter the Archives,

22:06.700 --> 22:08.920
I have to break through
all the mechanisms.

22:08.920 --> 22:10.460
In that case, Master, won't you have to—

22:10.460 --> 22:12.460
This thing must be done by you alone.

22:12.960 --> 22:15.090
I can tell you how to find the Archives.

22:15.420 --> 22:16.610
But as to how to get in

22:16.920 --> 22:18.780
and where the medicine is hidden,

22:18.960 --> 22:20.360
it's up to you to find out.

22:20.480 --> 22:24.820
[Horned Rhino] [Qilin's Blood] [Mud Wyrm]

22:23.390 --> 22:24.960
How long does Shrimpie have?

22:24.960 --> 22:27.870
[Countdown: 12 hours]

22:25.240 --> 22:26.310
12 hours.

22:28.070 --> 22:29.180
Down to the hour?

22:30.540 --> 22:32.460
Haizun only appears during the blood moon.

22:32.460 --> 22:33.640
According to my calculation,

22:33.640 --> 22:35.270
there will be a blood moon tonight.

22:35.270 --> 22:36.370
If you miss it,

22:36.400 --> 22:37.590
I don't know when the next time will be

22:37.590 --> 22:39.140
and whether Zhang Haixia

22:41.030 --> 22:42.360
can still be saved then.

22:47.170 --> 22:48.540
Starting now,

22:49.960 --> 22:51.510
you have 12 hours.

22:52.330 --> 22:53.770
Zhang Haixia's life

22:54.550 --> 22:55.520
is in your hands.

24:18.370 --> 24:19.120
Remember,

24:19.770 --> 24:21.230
conquer your true nature.

24:23.280 --> 24:25.190
This is really your last chance.

24:53.680 --> 24:56.940
[Zhang Han] [Zhang Haijiang]
[Zhang Hairong]

24:56.970 --> 24:59.640
[Zhang Haiqi] [Zhang Haixia]
[Zhang Hailou]

25:19.690 --> 25:20.400
Tonight,

25:21.020 --> 25:22.390
I will avenge all of you.

25:28.320 --> 25:29.140
Listen.

25:29.750 --> 25:31.660
The Archives is very large.

25:31.920 --> 25:33.600
Go and ask around

25:33.920 --> 25:35.250
the old address of the Archives

25:35.250 --> 25:37.750
which now stands Haili Bank.

25:37.850 --> 25:38.700
Go check if anything odd

25:38.700 --> 25:40.410
has happened around the area.

25:40.900 --> 25:42.440
Because the Archives' defense mechanism

25:42.440 --> 25:43.730
is very special.

25:44.380 --> 25:46.070
Maybe someone will notice something

25:46.070 --> 25:48.210
and help you find the entrance.

25:48.380 --> 25:50.360
You can only rely on yourself this time.

25:50.360 --> 25:52.550
I have something important to do.

25:53.070 --> 25:54.000
Come to think of it,

25:54.000 --> 25:56.250
there were 18 bowls in total.

25:56.660 --> 25:57.610
Before leaving,

25:57.610 --> 25:59.790
the shop owner pulled Erlang's sleeve.

25:59.790 --> 26:03.330
But the night
in Jingyang Hill was getting thicker.

26:03.330 --> 26:05.290
Erlang, under the influence of alcohol,

26:05.290 --> 26:06.420
with his bare hands—

26:16.200 --> 26:17.250
Hello, everyone.

26:17.500 --> 26:19.230
I'm the new storyteller here.

26:19.250 --> 26:20.200
I'm new here,

26:20.240 --> 26:22.950
so I do lack some good stories.

26:23.260 --> 26:25.500
So I would like to ask

26:25.530 --> 26:27.670
if there's anything interesting
that happened around here.

26:27.670 --> 26:28.730
I dare not say anything else—

26:28.730 --> 26:30.960
but I will make sure
you have tea and snacks to your fill.

26:28.800 --> 26:33.400
[Talking of Antiquity and Lamenting Today]

26:31.260 --> 26:31.860
I promise.

26:33.790 --> 26:36.190
Just say it if
you want to listen to stories.

26:36.200 --> 26:37.860
Who cares about the tea money?

26:38.110 --> 26:39.970
What story would you want to hear?

26:40.500 --> 26:43.070
I just want to listen to odd happenings

26:43.550 --> 26:45.200
in this area.

26:45.200 --> 26:46.380
Odd happenings?

26:46.570 --> 26:48.840
What I talked about yesterday—

26:49.830 --> 26:50.810
I have one.

26:51.290 --> 26:52.420
What do they know?

26:54.460 --> 26:56.660
Do you believe

26:56.960 --> 26:59.440
that walls can eat people?

26:59.690 --> 27:01.060
Really?

27:02.110 --> 27:03.550
Tell us.

27:03.920 --> 27:04.380
Tell us.

27:04.380 --> 27:06.510
Don't talk about it. Do you want to die?

27:08.070 --> 27:09.030
Do you know

27:09.380 --> 27:11.750
Hongtou Mazu Temple?

27:14.430 --> 27:18.240
[Hongtou Mazu Temple]

27:15.290 --> 27:18.090
Hongtou Mazu Temple is a temple
of the underworld.

27:23.330 --> 27:25.260
When we fishermen find human bones

27:25.530 --> 27:27.330
when out fishing,

27:27.660 --> 27:30.110
we will bring them
to the temple of the underworld.

27:30.110 --> 27:32.510
All beings grieve for their fellow beings.

28:22.070 --> 28:23.330
My goodness.

28:23.330 --> 28:25.460
Look at how decayed
the wall is.

28:34.790 --> 28:35.750
Immortal,

28:36.200 --> 28:38.380
I will fix this place.

28:58.900 --> 29:00.270
What book is this?

29:03.480 --> 29:05.140
So many cracks are drawn on it.

29:25.830 --> 29:28.350
[Hongtou Mazu Temple]

29:26.430 --> 29:27.850
Yet, in just a few days,

29:28.570 --> 29:30.640
Chen disappeared.

29:31.920 --> 29:32.380
Well...

29:51.880 --> 29:53.850
Chen died just like that.

29:54.290 --> 29:56.200
He stuffed himself into the wall crack

29:56.200 --> 29:57.610
and squeezed himself to death.

29:57.610 --> 29:59.840
Some say the gaps are alive,

30:00.030 --> 30:01.150
and some say

30:01.570 --> 30:05.140
those gaps lead to the Netherworld.

30:05.530 --> 30:06.920
But as to

30:07.530 --> 30:09.780
why the wall is eating humans

30:10.030 --> 30:11.570
and where it leads to—

30:12.110 --> 30:13.680
no one knows.

30:14.610 --> 30:15.960
Keep making up stories.

30:15.960 --> 30:16.530
Yeah.

30:16.530 --> 30:17.920
I know Chen.

30:17.920 --> 30:19.070
He's a thief.

30:19.070 --> 30:20.290
Every time he stole something,

30:20.290 --> 30:20.960
he would put it in the temple.

30:20.960 --> 30:21.660
Sir,

30:21.660 --> 30:23.460
you mentioned that ancient text

30:23.700 --> 30:24.530
had a few words.

30:24.530 --> 30:25.200
Do you remember

30:25.200 --> 30:26.290
what those words were?

30:26.290 --> 30:28.500
It was something like...

30:31.330 --> 30:38.780
[Southern Archives, No. 28]

30:37.500 --> 30:39.790
something something Archives.

30:52.030 --> 30:54.890
[Hongtou Mazu Temple]

32:02.320 --> 32:03.250
Hurry up!

32:02.850 --> 32:05.790
[Mo Faction Warlord Base, Xiacheng]

32:03.920 --> 32:05.850
Come on.
Those at the back, keep up.

32:07.000 --> 32:08.000
Okay, put it down.

32:10.330 --> 32:11.070
Hurry up!

32:11.070 --> 32:11.530
Come on!

32:12.660 --> 32:13.630
Hurry up!

32:15.030 --> 32:16.310
Lift it up!

32:18.270 --> 32:25.060
[Map of Xiacheng City]

32:25.800 --> 32:26.500
Come in.

32:29.210 --> 32:31.760
[Map of Xiacheng City]

32:32.030 --> 32:33.570
Sir, you wanted to see me?

32:33.570 --> 32:36.970
Zhang Haiqi came back
posing as the daughter of the Ship King.

32:37.160 --> 32:38.150
Also,

32:38.420 --> 32:39.850
your sister Bai Zhu

32:40.030 --> 32:41.230
died.

32:42.060 --> 32:46.880
[Assassin, Bai Yu]

32:44.240 --> 32:46.610
She was killed by Zhang Haiqi

32:46.660 --> 32:48.830
carrying out the mission on the boat.

32:51.950 --> 32:53.480
Did you bring her body back?

32:53.570 --> 32:55.560
You don't know Zhang Haiqi.

32:56.110 --> 32:57.970
She doesn't leave the body intact

32:59.570 --> 33:01.960
when killing someone.

33:18.260 --> 33:20.650
I missed you so much,

33:21.080 --> 33:22.570
Miss Dong.

33:22.920 --> 33:24.310
You're not Mo Yungao.

33:45.030 --> 33:46.230
Where is Zhang Haiqi?

33:47.900 --> 33:49.400
Where is Zhang Haiqi?

33:52.030 --> 33:53.310
The armory exploded!

33:53.570 --> 33:55.730
Sir, someone set up explosives!

34:02.420 --> 34:03.290
Guards!

34:04.830 --> 34:05.880
Seal off the base immediately.

34:05.880 --> 34:07.410
You must catch Zhang Haiqi!

34:07.420 --> 34:08.080
-Yes!
-Yes!

35:20.620 --> 35:22.160
Over there! Chase!

37:02.280 --> 37:04.220
Zhang Haiqi!

37:34.520 --> 37:35.310
Sir,

37:35.340 --> 37:37.530
Commander sent an emergency telegram.

37:37.530 --> 37:38.390
Read it.

37:42.900 --> 37:44.430
I heard that

37:44.460 --> 37:46.870
Zhang Haiqi pretended
to be the daughter of the Ship King,

37:46.870 --> 37:48.140
Miss Dong,

37:48.170 --> 37:49.770
and has returned to Xiacheng.

37:49.770 --> 37:52.560
This is due to your negligence.

37:52.950 --> 37:55.380
We must capture Zhang Haiqi,

37:55.400 --> 37:57.060
the location of the Archives,

37:57.310 --> 38:00.040
and obtain related files
of the patriarch of the Zhang family.

38:00.040 --> 38:02.130
If you fail your mission again,

38:02.920 --> 38:03.760
you...

38:04.860 --> 38:07.310
you shall die as an apology.

38:23.500 --> 38:24.880
Pass my order.

38:26.190 --> 38:28.380
Take the rest of the equipment

38:28.400 --> 38:29.860
to the Dong Residence.

38:32.110 --> 38:36.560
I don't believe we can't catch
Zhang Haiqi.
